---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Contact"
	description="How to reach The Trend Times editors with questions, tips, corrections, and privacy requests."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-11-04')}
	updatedDate={new Date('2026-11-04')}
	eyebrow="CONTACT"
	showDate={false}
>
	<p>Email is the fastest way to reach us. Pick the address that matches your message so it lands with the right person.</p>

	<h2>General questions and partnerships</h2>
	<p><a href="mailto:contact@thetrendtimes.com">contact@thetrendtimes.com</a></p>

	<h2>Story tips and corrections</h2>
	<p>
		<a href="mailto:editor@thetrendtimes.com">editor@thetrendtimes.com</a>. If you spot an error, include the article link
		and the source that shows the correct information. We publish corrections at the end of the affected article.
	</p>

	<h2>Privacy requests</h2>
	<p>
		To ask what we hold about you, or to have it deleted, write to
		<a href="mailto:contact@thetrendtimes.com?subject=Privacy%20request">contact@thetrendtimes.com</a> with the subject
		line "Privacy request". Our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains what we collect.
	</p>

	<h2>Newsletter</h2>
	<p>
		To join or leave The Weekly Signal, email
		<a href="mailto:contact@thetrendtimes.com?subject=Subscribe%3A%20The%20Weekly%20Signal">contact@thetrendtimes.com</a>
		with "Subscribe" or "Unsubscribe" in the subject line.
	</p>
</Layout>
